、光通信网络和系统方向：具备光系统关键技术原理、器件/信道/网络模型等知识，熟悉光纤中各种线性&amp;非线性损伤的产生机理及其对光信号产生的传输代价；<br>3、光传输系统数字化方向：熟悉通信网络和数字化需求，熟练掌握光纤传感、光谱感知等基础知识，理解传输系统架构、传输性能检测原理、光Sensor器件及系统等；<br>4、光放大技术方向：具备光放大器仿真建模或实验原型验证经验，能够深入理解各类型光放大器的物理原理，熟悉光放大器在光通信网络中的应用场景；<br>5、空间光通信技术方向：具备跟瞄系统光机光学设计经验，大气信道的仿真建模能力，光通信系统的架构设计经验等。<br>","jobResponsibilitiesMalaysia":null,"jobDemandMalaysia":null,"jobResponsibilitiesWe":null,"jobDemandWe":null,"externalPostCode":"JT2026071600127","demandId":null,"deptAndPlaceList":[{"deptCode":"079605","deptName":"计算技术研究院","jobPlace":"China\\Guangdong-Shenzhen,China\\Beijing-Beijing,China\\Shanghai-Shanghai,China\\Jiangsu-Nanjing,China\\Zhejiang-Hangzhou","jobPlaceName":"深圳/北京/上海/南京/杭州"},{"deptCode":"079605","deptName":"计算技术研究院","jobPlace":"China\\Guangdong-Shenzhen,China\\Beijing-Beijing,China\\Shanghai-Shanghai,China\\Jiangsu-Nanjing,China\\Zhejiang-Hangzhou","jobPlaceName":"深圳/北京/上海/南京/杭州"},{"deptCode":"079605","deptName":"计算技术研究院","jobPlace":"China\\Guangdong-Shenzhen,China\\Beijing-Beijing,China\\Shanghai-Shanghai,China\\Jiangsu-Nanjing,China\\Zhejiang-Hangzhou","jobPlaceName":"深圳/北京/上海/南京/杭州"},{"deptCode":"079605","deptName":"计算技术研究院","jobPlace":"China\\Guangdong-Shenzhen,China\\Beijing-Beijing,China\\Shanghai-Shanghai,China\\Jiangsu-Nanjing,China\\Zhejiang-Hangzhou","jobPlaceName":"深圳/北京/上海/南京/杭州"},{"deptCode":"079606","deptName":"通信技术研究院","jobPlace":"China\\Guangdong-Shenzhen,China\\Beijing-Beijing,China\\Shanghai-Shanghai,China\\Jiangsu-Nanjing,China\\Zhejiang-Hangzhou,China\\Anhui-Hefei,China\\Sichuan-Chengdu,China\\Hubei-Wuhan","jobPlaceName":"深圳/北京/上海/南京/杭州/合肥/成都/武汉"},{"deptCode":"079606","deptName":"通信技术研究院","jobPlace":"China\\Guangdong-Shenzhen,China\\Beijing-Beijing,China\\Shanghai-Shanghai,China\\Jiangsu-Nanjing,China\\Zhejiang-Hangzhou,China\\Anhui-Hefei,China\\Sichuan-Chengdu,China\\Hubei-Wuhan","jobPlaceName":"深圳/北京/上海/南京/杭州/合肥/成都/武汉"},{"deptCode":"079606","deptName":"通信技术研究院","jobPlace":"China\\Guangdong-Shenzhen,China\\Beijing-Beijing,China\\Shanghai-Shanghai